nd":"text","t":58691.722309000004,"text":"Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here. "},{"kind":"audio","t":58736.822925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58738.492138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58740.203863999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58740.382983,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":59001.998175999994,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":70445.49681499999,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70870.59178599999,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109. "},{"kind":"audio","t":70922.859279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70924.411455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70925.947326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70927.661626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70929.414144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70930.91593399999,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"route","t":70931.055795,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":72312.54695999999,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72511.67508999999,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team. "},{"kind":"audio","t":72553.886979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72555.637273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72557.292534,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"route","t":77501.60184,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":83652.922157,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. "},{"kind":"audio","t":83696.86368899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":83698.78618299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83700.26768199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":83700.44243499999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84739.92839999999,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":84862.706873,"text":"He passed away shortly after. "},{"kind":"audio","t":84903.341178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84904.956078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":84905.091642,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":86401.344204,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":92815.914645,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. "},{"kind":"audio","t":92862.74678799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92864.024791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92865.71194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92867.56569999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":92867.722707,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94627.52514299999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":94857.616423,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee. "},{"kind":"audio","t":94903.211403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":94904.746914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94906.546262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94907.84815199999,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"route","t":95601.101834,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":100804.82527,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":101065.761521,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese. "},{"kind":"audio","t":101113.073406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101115.274158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101116.619092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101118.55781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":101118.724131,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":101602.130932,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":110918.68431,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area. "},{"kind":"audio","t":110967.22304099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110968.756049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110970.447755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":110972.276296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":110974.06671099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":110974.345501,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113046.96066299999,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"route","t":113501.96077199999,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":118978.001368,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":119372.90978799999,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them. "},{"kind":"audio","t":119426.548405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":119427.86803099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119429.54233099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119431.28283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119433.023901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119434.846634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119436.720604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":119436.870209,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":120501.526135,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":129633.71546400001,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":130205.431611,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G. "},{"kind":"audio","t":130262.19744399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130263.61736099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130265.36685399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130267.10354799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130268.93147899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130270.75316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130272.53716499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130274.60357499999,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"route","t":130601.34320100001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":142072.462168,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142507.57294399999,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that Nepal’s UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti. "},{"kind":"audio","t":142563.60366999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142564.843356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":142566.493529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142568.436063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":142570.456133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142572.421251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":142574.18236099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":142575.975109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142577.896571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":142578.02853,"samples":6888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":142578.101259,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":151371.52730699998,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. "},{"kind":"audio","t":151425.54912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151426.903609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":151428.603046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151430.40627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151431.663642,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":153490.6673,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland. Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam."},{"kind":"text","t":153682.295492,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. "},{"kind":"audio","t":153727.001745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153728.664818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153729.885124,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"route","t":153900.467703,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":156180.76847399998,"text":"Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":156436.59336199999,"text":"Not even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex could match him. "},{"kind":"audio","t":156480.015783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156481.653929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156483.651124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":156483.771125,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":157100.764485,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":168827.124988,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":169225.528177,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions—face movements that last just a few milliseconds. "},{"kind":"audio","t":169277.468915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169278.728811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169280.580208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169282.350743,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169284.177162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169286.068849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169287.998984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169288.558566,"samples":14824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"route","t":169288.645207,"type":"ro